{
  "name": "Chakra9 - 06 Video Processor (Cloud Compatible)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "process-video",
        "options": {
          "responseMode": "responseNode"
        }
      },
      "id": "webhook-trigger",
      "name": "Process Video Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [0, 0],
      "webhookId": "process-video"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Prepare video processing job for external worker\nconst input = $input.first().json.body || $input.first().json;\n\nconst job = {\n  job_id: `job_${Date.now()}`,\n  yacht_id: input.yacht_id,\n  source_url: input.source_url,\n  source_file_id: input.source_file_id,\n  clips: input.clips || [],\n  vertical: input.vertical !== false,\n  burn_subtitles: input.burn_subtitles || false,\n  overlays: input.overlays || [],\n  webhook_callback: input.webhook_callback || null,\n  created_at: new Date().toISOString()\n};\n\nreturn [{ json: job }];"
      },
      "id": "prep-job",
      "name": "Prepare Job",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [220, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $env.VIDEO_FACTORY_URL || 'https://your-video-factory.railway.app' }}/process-clip-pack",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 300000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "fullResponse": true
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "call-video-factory",
      "name": "Call Video Factory",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [440, 0],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Video Factory API Key"
        }
      },
      "continueOnFail": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "typeValidation": "strict" },
          "combinator": "and",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "success-check",
              "operator": { "type": "number", "operation": "equals" },
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.statusCode }}",
              "rightValue": 200
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "if-success",
      "name": "IF Success",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [660, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Parse successful response\nconst response = $input.first().json;\nconst job = $('Prepare Job').first().json;\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    success: true,\n    job_id: job.job_id,\n    yacht_id: job.yacht_id,\n    result: response.body || response.data,\n    completed_at: new Date().toISOString()\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "parse-success",
      "name": "Parse Success",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [880, -100]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Handle error\nconst response = $input.first().json;\nconst job = $('Prepare Job').first().json;\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    success: false,\n    job_id: job.job_id,\n    yacht_id: job.yacht_id,\n    error: response.body?.error || response.statusMessage || 'Unknown error',\n    status_code: response.statusCode,\n    failed_at: new Date().toISOString()\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "parse-error",
      "name": "Parse Error",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [880, 100]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ $json }}"
      },
      "id": "respond",
      "name": "Respond",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [1100, 0]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Video Processor (n8n Cloud Compatible)\n\n### Requires:\n- External Video Factory service deployed on:\n  - Railway (recommended)\n  - Render\n  - Fly.io\n  - Any VPS with FFmpeg\n\n### Setup:\n1. Deploy worker/ to Railway/Render\n2. Set VIDEO_FACTORY_URL in n8n variables\n3. Create 'Video Factory API Key' credential (Header Auth)\n\n### Input:\n```json\n{\n  \"yacht_id\": \"spysea\",\n  \"source_url\": \"https://drive.google.com/...\",\n  \"clips\": [...],\n  \"vertical\": true\n}\n```",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 360
      },
      "id": "sticky-note",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-280, -100]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Process Video Webhook": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Prepare Job", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Prepare Job": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Call Video Factory", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Call Video Factory": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "IF Success", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "IF Success": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Parse Success", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
        [{ "node": "Parse Error", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Parse Success": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Respond", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Parse Error": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Respond", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    }
  },
  "settings": { "executionOrder": "v1" },
  "tags": [
    { "name": "chakra9" },
    { "name": "video" },
    { "name": "cloud" }
  ]
}
